                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nIf the injectable solution is not clear or if precipitate is present, the medication would not be used and needs to be discarded. The nurse may have to call the pharmacy department to obtain another vial of the medication. The remaining options are inaccurate actions.",
