                        "content": "A client is having the dosage of clonazepam adjusted. The nurse would plan to perform which action?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nClonazepam is a benzodiazepine that is used as an anticonvulsant. During initial therapy and during periods of dosage adjustment, the nurse would initiate seizure precautions for the client. Weight, glucose levels, and ecchymosis are unrelated to this medication.",
                        "id": "0a06adc9db0142ccb6613af8e702920a",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
