                                "content": "These symptoms probably result from interaction with another medication."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "ef3e77ffd31d4934aad2cb31680dc0c2",
                                "content": "These symptoms usually occur when the client takes the medication with food."
